        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HOW LONG CAN YOU SURVIVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Vampire Cat is a 2D Idle Roguelike Survivor. </strong>Place up to 3 vampire cats on the map, face waves of enemies and bosses in random maps. Collect loot (blue diamonds, purple orbs, artifacts), level up, improve your cats, your wheel, and survive as long as possible! How far will you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505650/extras/7561e200c2a6e5f81cd7f579c67ed170.poster.avif?t=1765902522\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505650/extras/7561e200c2a6e5f81cd7f579c67ed170.webm?t=1765902522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505650/extras/7561e200c2a6e5f81cd7f579c67ed170.mp4?t=1765902522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEFEAT BOSSES &amp; WIN PURPLE ORBS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Defeat enemies and bosses, collect blue diamonds and purple orbs to upgrade your vampire cats' skills.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505650/extras/8173955a02472930da206060dbea2c31.poster.avif?t=1765902522\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505650/extras/8173955a02472930da206060dbea2c31.webm?t=1765902522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505650/extras/8173955a02472930da206060